{"content":[{"c":["JOIARIB"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of the Jewish leaders whom Ezra sent to Iddo at Casiphia to gather Levites and temple servants for the caravan of Jews returning to Palestine from Babylon (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.16","r":"Ezra.8.16","rawR":"Ezra.8.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.16","value":"Ezra.8.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:16"},"). He is alternately called Jehoiarib in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.10","r":"1Chr.9.10","rawR":"1Chr.9.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.10","value":"1Chr.9.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 9:10"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Zechariah’s son, the father of Adaiah, and an ancestor of a Judahite family that resettled in Jerusalem during the postexilic era under Nehemiah (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.5","r":"Neh.11.5","rawR":"Neh.11.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.5","value":"Neh.11.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Father of Jedaiah, a priest who served in the temple during the days of Nehemiah (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.10","r":"Neh.11.10","rawR":"Neh.11.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.10","value":"Neh.11.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:10"},"). Perhaps Joiarib’s forefather was Jehoiarib, who was the head of the first course of priests ministering in the sanctuary during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.7","r":"1Chr.24.7","rawR":"1Chr.24.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.7","value":"1Chr.24.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 24:7"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.10","r":"1Chr.9.10","rawR":"1Chr.9.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.10","value":"1Chr.9.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. One of the leaders of the priests who returned with Zerubbabel and Jeshua to Judah after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.6","r":"Neh.12.6","rawR":"Neh.12.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.6","value":"Neh.12.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:6"},"). His family in the next generation was headed by Mattenai (v ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.19","r":"Neh.12.19","rawR":"Neh.12.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.19","value":"Neh.12.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Joiarib","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ezr 8:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.16","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.16","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.16"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 9:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.10","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.10","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.10"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.5","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.5","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.5"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.10","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.10","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.10"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 24:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.24.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.24.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.24.7"},{"anchorText":"9:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.10","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.10","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.10"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.6","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.6","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.6"},{"anchorText":"19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.19","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.19","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.19"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"3ef0ff051bb00dc72a28f7d8adfed16eda7d3884bcc795e70b639a2878a576cf","sourceItemName":"Joiarib","sourceItemOrder":290,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Joiarib","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Joiarib","title":"Joiarib","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}